  day: 2
  text: '*You here heavy footsteps echo towards you. The whir of machinery and the
    grasping of air came from a being more steel than flesh. It shuffle towards your
    desk, hunched and stiff. From it a screech emerged, it sounded as the cry of
    dying beast* ASSIGN ME. ASSIGN ME. ASSIGN ME. ASSIGN ME.'
